+++
title: Join the Collective
description: How to become a coach in the Yomonsni collective
+++


We are always interested in bringing new coaches into the collective.

In the words of Ratatouille, "Anyone can cook."

We don't think you are defined by your background. Anyone has the potential to be a great coach, but turning potential into realized life is something you have to do with conscious effort.

We can help, if you want. We are happy to teach what we know, though we require you to also get some outside education about coaching (we don't want to get too insular, and are always trying to learn more ourselves). 

If you are already an experienced coach we will want to experience you coaching us to see if you match our vibe. 


If you like our methodology and approach and would be interested in talking with us about joining, please get in touch.

